    <question_explanation no="17" id="PRB-1509E492EE1BBA8E-Q17">
      <question_stem>자유공간에서 전위가 &lt;i&gt;V&lt;/i&gt; ＝ 2(x^(2) ＋ y^(2)) [V]일 때, 체적전하밀도[C/m^(3)]는? (단, $\epsilon_0$는 자유공간의 유전율이다)</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>자유공간에서</keyword>
        <keyword>전위</keyword>
        <keyword>체적전하밀도</keyword>
        <keyword>자유공간</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$- 8 \epsilon_{0}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기자기학 · 푸아송 방정식
정답은 ②이다. 푸아송 방정식 ∇²V = -ρv/ε0에서 ∇²V = 4 + 4 = 8이므로 ρv = -8ε0이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$- \frac{8}{\epsilon_{0}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>ε0가 분모에 오지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$- 8 \epsilon_{0}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>-8ε0이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$- \frac{4}{\epsilon_{0}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>맞지 않다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
